B.Wx=new A.u("feature_attach_burrowing","Burrowing","When an enemy starts their turn with you attached, they gain {Half Source} d6 Bleed. When an ally starts their turn with you attached, They take {Half Source d6} damage and they gain {Half Source} d12 Regeneration.")
B.Xh=new A.u("feature_attach_scuttling","Scuttling","When an enemy ends their turn with you attached, make a Status Check vs Str. On Success, force them to move {Source}. When an ally ends their turn with you attached, force them to move {Half Source}.")
