B.Y7=new A.ap("feature_eruption","Eruption","[Action] Target a free space within {2 + Source} spaces. You sink into the ground, teleport to that location, then erupt from the ground making a Melee Attack vs Dex against Enemies range 1. On Success, Deal {Source d8} Damage.\n\n[Reaction] Before you make a Melee Attack, Spend your reaction and target a free space within {1 + Source} and teleport there. If you succeed on the triggering melee attack deal {Source d8} damage vs Dex to each enemy range 1 of you.",B.N,B.acE,!1,!0,null,null)
