B.Zh=new A.ap("feature_forced_martyrdom","Forced Martyrdom","[Action] Make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting an enemy range 1. On Success, Deal {source d8} Damage and you resist all damage from attacks. When you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Miss the effect ends.\n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on an attack or an ally fails on an attack, spend your reaction and target one of the targets of the triggering attack. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Wis and you resist all damage from attacks and when you take damage the target takes the same amount. At the start of your turn, make an Status Check vs the target\u2019s Wis, On Success, they continue to be affected, on Problems the effect ends.\n\nIf you have multiple targets affected by this at once, choose when you take damage which target takes the damage with you.",B.N,B.a8l,!1,!0,null,null)
B.TY=new A.u("feature_illusions_behind_the_curtain","Behind the Curtain","You and your allies can move through your illusions without breaking them. You and your allies may end your turn inside your illusion walls, preventing them from being able to be targeted by enemies as long as there is an illusion. If an enemy would be able to target a creature under your illusion with an ability, they can target the illusions in the spaces instead.")
