B.RZ=new A.u("feature_illusions_smoke_and_mirrors","Smoke and Mirrors","When an enemy destroys one of your illusions, you or your allies adjacent to the illusions gain +1 to defense results until the start of their next turn. [Reaction] When you or your allies are adjacent to an illusion and are targeted by an attack, they can spend their reaction to force them to target the illusion instead.")
B.Wc=new A.u("feature_illusions_unnerving_movement","Unnerving Movement","While concentrating, at the start of any turn, spend your [Reaction] target 1 illusion and move it {Source} spaces then make a status check vs Int targeting enemies range {Source} of the illusion. On success, deal {Source d6} damage.")
