B.Zf=new A.ap("feature_wave","Wave","[Action] target all enemies within a {Source}x{Source} box with at least 1 space adjacent to you and Make an Melee Attack vs Str. On success, deal {Source d8} damage and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.\n\n[Reaction] when you or an ally range {Source} succeeds a defense, Spend your reaction, and target all enemies within {Half Source} of the Triggering character. Deal {Half Source d8} damage vs Str and push them up to {Source} in the same direction.",B.N,B.acv,!1,!0,null,null)
B.U2=new A.u("feature_weapon_attack_Charge","Charge","Before making a Melee Weapon attack, Move up to {2*Source} in a straight line toward the target. If you moved at least 2 spaces, gain a +1 to the attack result.")
B.XR=new A.u("feature_weapon_attack_culling","Culling","When you kill an enemy, You may make an attack with a weapon you are holding dealing {Source d6} extra damage on a Success. The extra culling attack may not trigger a culling attack.")
B.XM=new A.u("feature_weapon_attack_penetrating","Penetrating","After you Succeed with a weapon attack, the attack ignores damage Resistance and Shield.")
B.Wn=new A.u("feature_weapon_attack_sacrifice","Sacrifice","On Success, you may deal yourself up to {Source d6} damage ignoring shield and resistance, and increase your damage by the same number of d12.")
