B.Y5=new A.ap("feature_whirlwind","Whirlwind","[Action]: Make a Melee attack vs Dex Targeting enemies range 2. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range. \n\n[Reaction] When you succeed on attack or when an ally fails with their action, spend your reaction and target all enemies range 2, and deal {Half Source d6} damage vs Dex, and you may dash any enemies in range to a free space in range.",B.N,B.ab8,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Um=new A.u("feature_wreath_of_flames_Bonfire","Bonfire","Increase the range of the status check to {1 + Half Power}.")
B.Vk=new A.u("feature_wreath_of_flames_Living_Inferno","Living Inferno","The target gains {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. If you target an ally, they have {Half Source} d12 regeneration as long as they have this burn.")
B.Tb=new A.u("feature_wreath_of_flames_Thorn_Wreath","Thorn Wreath","Whenever the target fails a melee defense, both the target and the attacker gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. Allies do not gain this burn.")
B.aat=s([B.Um,B.Vk,B.Tb],t.U)
B.Zd=new A.ap("feature_wreath_of_flames","Wreath of Flames","[Reaction] During your or an ally turn, Target a creature within 1 space. As long as you are concentrating, whenever an enemy starts their turn within 1 space of the Target, or becomes within 1 space of them for the first time during their turn, make an Status Check Vs Dex. On Success, they gain {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex. The target of the wreath of flame doesn\u2019t trigger the status check.\n\n[Reaction] After you or an ally fails a defense, You may begin concentrating on Wreath of flame targeting the triggering ally. If the triggering defense was from a Melee Attack, give the attacker {Half Source} d6 Burn vs Dex.",B.az,B.aat,!1,!0,null,null)
B.Wl=new A.u("feature_wraith_Drain","Drain","On success, You or the triggering ally gain {Half Source d6} shield.")
B.VR=new A.u("feature_wraith_Rip","Rip","On Success with the reaction, if the triggering attack also succeeds give the target {Source} d6 bleed.")
B.SV=new A.u("feature_wraith_Torment","Torment","On Success, until the end of your next turn, the target gets a -1 on defense results while within 3 of you.")
B.acg=s([B.Wl,B.VR,B.SV],t.U)
B.Yi=new A.ap("feature_wraith","Wraith","[Action] Dash {Half Source} then make a Melee Attack vs Wis targeting 1 enemy range 3. On Success, deal {Source d6} damage and this damage ignores shield and resistance.\n\n[Reaction] When you or an ally range 6 succeed with a Melee attack during their turn, spend your reaction and Deal {Source/3 d6} damage vs Wis, and this damage and the triggering attack\u2019s damage ignores Shield and Resistance.",B.N,B.acg,!1,!0,null,null)
