B.anD=new A.cS("source_innate","Innate","The character can use the ability as much as they like, using a Source value of {Half Power}. If the feature only has the innate source gain +1 to the source value.","If you only have innate as your only source, gain +1 to skill results.","Next scene gain +1 to skills you're proficient in, or next situation start with {Power + Level} shield.","You have -1 to attacks and proficient skills.","{Half Power}",B.Is,!1,null,null,B.W,B.W,null)
